28:01.080 --> 28:01.600
Aku mau.

28:01.800 --> 28:02.480
Dua puluh yuan.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.320
Aku tawar 100 yuan.

28:03.320 --> 28:04.000
Aku bilang aku tawar 100 yuan.

28:04.000 --> 28:04.800
Halo, Ibu.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.640
Yan,

28:07.680 --> 28:08.840
